# Where a contact-form submission is delivered. Any endpoint that accepts a
# JSON POST — a Zapier/Make hook, a Resend function, the studio's CRM.
#
# Leave this unset and /api/contact returns 503 on purpose: the app queues the
# lead and retries rather than showing a visitor a success state for an
# enquiry that went nowhere. If the studio does not want a form on the screen,
# set CONTACT.formEnabled to false in content/contact.ts and ship QR only.
CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=
